window.products.push({"id":790247,"name":"Wine Country Holiday Cheer Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FQ274TRDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description For those who deserve complete extravagance, we've designed this sensational gift basket with as many gourmet treats as we were able. Amazon.com Whip up a batch of eggnog or mull some holiday wine to pair with this elegant basket of goodies and you've got an instant holiday party spread, including festive serveware. The set comes with two 4-3/4-inch olive-oil dipping bowls with a pretty fleur de lis pattern, six blue and cream petite party napkins, and two 6-1/2-inch stainless-steel cheese utensils with wooden handles. Guests will find it difficult to choose from the many tasty goodies. The crispy sesame water crackers, sourdough wine bites, and cheese baguettes all pair wonderfully with the creamy Camembert cheese spread. Set out some crusty fresh bread and olive oil, sprinkled with the bread dipping herbs, for guests to sop up. Meat and seafood lovers can indulge in slices of Italian beef salami and slivers of smoked salmon. You'll want to present the gourmet mixed whole olives in their own jar--the elegant clear urn shows off their colors. For dessert, impress your guests with the decadent French raspberry liqueur cake or set out the Scandinavian butter cookies in their artful gold tin featuring Renoir's well-loved Luncheon of the Boating Party . Let friends help themselves to the berry bonbons for the ride home, and save the hot cocoa mix in its adorable milk-can-style tin for yourself to have after the party! All items arrive artfully arranged in a 21-3/4-by-9-1/4-by-10-1/2-inch brass-handled rectangular wicker basket, festively tied with navy and gold ribbon. --Maile Bohlmann","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FQ274TRDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houdini","source_asin":"B000070R5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000070R5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000070R5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
