window.products.push({"id":790268,"name":"Bellemain Over Sink Drying Rack - Collapsible Space Saving Roll Up Sink Rack, Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack for Kitchen Sink - Foldable Stainless Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B0i+W2FxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLICITY, DESIGNED BY BELLEMAIN: Our signature over-the-sink kitchen rack offers at-home chefs everything they need to “up” their cuisine game. Use the extra counter-space you gain to prep vegetables, get a head-start on dishes, or store hot pans while cooking. DESIGNED TO HELP YOU COOK MORE, WORRY LESS: At Bellemain, we believe artisanal tools should make life in the kitchen easier. That’s why our kitchen rack is completely dishwasher safe. Not only that, we’ve also designed it perfectly to fit any sink 16.5-inch wide or shallower, and so it folds up easy to disappear when company arrives. KITCHENWARE DESERVES BELLEMAIN: Bowls. Cups. Plates. They all get chipped eventually. Or they used to, before Bellemain. Protect your lovely dishes with Bellemain’s BPA-free silicone skin that embraces your dishes with a soft touch and keeps them safe while hanging out. THE STANDARD FOR STRENGTH: We forge each over-the-sink roll-up dish drying rack with soft, strong skin that handles heats up to 400° and high-quality stainless steel that can support over 24 pounds. You’ll understand “The Bellemain Standard” the minute you unpack it. SAVE SPACE FOR ANY SINK UP TO 16” WIDE: This 18” rack sits over any sink, and rolls up easily to fit inside almost any drawer, cabinet, or free space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B0i+W2FxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemain","source_asin":"B095ZXF6J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095ZXF6J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095ZXF6J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":790269,"name":"DCF Box Pleated Tailored Split Corner 1-Piece Bed Skirt 16 inches Inch Drop Length 100 Percent Egyptian Cotton 600 Thread Count, Queen (60 inches x 80","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yjedB-B-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DCF Box Pleated Tailored Split Corner 1-Piece Bed Skirt 16 inches Inch Drop Length 100 Percent Egyptian Cotton 600 Thread Count, Queen (60 inches x 80 inches) Size, Burgundy, PDE-LYT-HIW-147-QN-BUR","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yjedB-B-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DCF","source_asin":"B08PZ23DVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PZ23DVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PZ23DVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":790270,"name":"Sumi Brush Cat Wall Decor by Lowell S.V. Devin, 35 x 47\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911FVv2sVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a cat. Lowell S.V. Devin proves that the true grand Syntheses of Fine Art resides in the precise aesthetic fusion of both Florentine and French Schools of Drawing and Painting, respectively. His extraordinary stylus palette superbly blends complex medium variations so masterfully that each individual work inherently possesses an independent quality and refined sensitivity which, in the artist's own words, \"redefines the Present by uniting the Past.\" From subtle pastoral settings to bold industrial themes, from majestic maritime to classical ballet and on to matchless portraiture, Lowell Devin's unparalleled range of subjects and styles will vigorously complement your design ideas with no direct intrusion into the designated space. This is accomplished through the artist's spectacular use of vibrant complementary colors and textures rhythmically juxtaposed to dramatically impart an \"inversion of expectancy\" in the eye of the beholder. Lowell S.V. Devin Collection has been personally reviewed as \"outstanding\" by Doug Rowan, Fmr. Pres. & CEO, Corbis Corporation, the largest digital archive in the world. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911FVv2sVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00WUF1CHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WUF1CHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WUF1CHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
