window.products.push({"id":790341,"name":"Scientists Posters for Classroom or Bedroom - set of 3 posters for kids K-6 - Laminated 18x24 (Thomas Edison, Marie Curie and the Wright Brothers) by ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6UO7pdEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET OF 3 POSTERS : Marie Curie, Thomas Edison & The Wright Brothers Perfect decoration to motivate your kids! Recommended for kids bedroom, playroom or classroom Recommended for kids bedroom, playroom or classroom Each poster includes a timeline of the most significant events in the Superheroes lives, telling the story of world renowned innovators and scientists. Each poster includes a timeline of the most significant events in the Superheroes lives, telling the story of world renowned innovators and scientists. Show your child that hard work is REWARDED, failure is a part of the process and PERSISTENCY is the key to SUCCESS. Show your child that hard work is REWARDED, failure is a part of the process and PERSISTENCY is the key to SUCCESS. TEACHER FAVORITES - Build a natural CURIOSITY by exposing your little learners to SCIENTIFIC BREAKTHROUGHS, ARTISTIC ACHIEVEMENT and ENTREPRENEURIAL SUCCESS ! TEACHER FAVORITES - Build a natural CURIOSITY by exposing your little learners to SCIENTIFIC BREAKTHROUGHS, ARTISTIC ACHIEVEMENT and ENTREPRENEURIAL SUCCESS ! Inspiring wall decor for PEDIATRICS or any doctor's office Inspiring wall decor for PEDIATRICS or any doctor's office Premium Quality Product! Our posters are made from 160gsm paper, coated with heated rolled lamination and packed carefully to assure perfect delivery to your home Our posters are made from 160gsm paper, coated with heated rolled lamination and packed carefully to assure perfect delivery to your home Posters dimensions: 18 X 24 inches standard size Posters dimensions: 18 X 24 inches standard size To make your children even happier, we added a small gift to EVERY package: To make your children even happier, we added a small gift to EVERY package: FREE set of STICKERS of our real-human superheroes and a fun and inspiring ACTIVITY PAGE Meet the SUPERHEROES! Marie Curie: She was a physicist and chemist who conducted pioneering research on radioactivity.  She was the first woman to win a Nobel Prize and the first person to win it twice! Thomas A. Edison: America's greatest inventor !  Mostly known for developing the practical electric light-bulb, phonograph and the motion picture camera.  There are 1,093 US patents in his name! The Wright Brothers Orville and Wilbur Wright were two American aviators, engineers, inventors, and aviation pioneers  who are generally credited with inventing, building, and flying the world's first successful airplane!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6UO7pdEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantim","source_asin":"B07F278556","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F278556","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F278556","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":790342,"name":"Tangkula Standing Desk, Height Adjustable Pneumatic Stand Up Desk w/Cable Management Holes, Carbon Fiber Surface, Ergonomic Sit to Stand Computer Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YQqMItU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adjust it to Your Desired Height】The computer desk features a pneumatic lifting handle so that you can adjust it to your desired height within the range of 29\" to 41\". It is worth mentioning that pushing down the tabletop with your both hands and hold the handle up to lower the height would be better. Stable adjustment with less noise brings perfect using experience as well. 【Wide & Ergonomic Fiber Carbon Tabletop】The wide tabletop is ideally sized to accommodate 2 computers and thus multi tasking can be easily achieved. Premium fiber carbon surface delivers unique tactility which provides you with more comfortable touching feeling. Moreover, ergonomic curve in the front of the tabletop is specially designed to adapt to your working habit. 【Keep All of Messy Wires Organized】Messy working surrounding caused by different kinds of wires may ruin good mood and reduce working efficiency. Therefore, the workstation is equipped with a convenient power strip tray under the desk to help you keep wire organized. There are also 2 cable management holes on the desktop to keep a neat work area further. 【Ultra Stable & Sturdy Metal Structure】Made of high quality iron material, the computer desk shows perfect performance in sturdiness and lasting durability. Advanced powder coated technology also makes it not easy to rust. Meanwhile, the adjustable foot pads ensure exceptional stability even on uneven ground. 【Study or Work in a Comfortable Position】The computer desk combining professional craftsmanship and modern pure black style is sure to be a perfect addition in your house of office. It takes the comfortableness of studying, working or gaming to high level, since it allows you to stand up to work if you are too tired to sit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YQqMItU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B08NVPYFW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVPYFW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVPYFW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
