window.products.push({"id":790387,"name":"Ramekins Set with 6 Silicone Lids, Mothers Day Gifts Creme Brulee Making Set,304 Stainless Steel Lifting Rack and 10\" X 14.6\" Bottom Baking Pan, Set o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v5cBIq0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【All in One Set】:This set comes with all the necessary parts to make delicious creme brulee, 6 porcelain ramekins with storage lids, lifting rack and bottom pan.The 10\" X 14.6\" bottom pan easily holds all 6 ramekins at once, allowing you to batch-prepare creme brulees and other ramekin recipes. Glazed porcelain is Lid-free and versatile, unlike plastic. Never worry about harmful toxins leaching into your food. Safe to use around your family. 【Up-graded Ramekins with Lids】: PLSFIT ramekins are upgraded and come with 6 silicone lids so you can store your dessert more conveniently. These lids provide a safe seal for your food to keep it fresh, the lids fit perfectly on the ramekins，also the baked items can stay warm after they are taken out of the oven. These lids are made from healthy and durable silicone material which is recyclable and more environmentally friendly. 【Durable and Food Safe】: The thick, stackable porcelain ramekins are lead-free, and made to withstand both high or low temp for easy baking and freezing. The wire rack is made from durable 304 stainless steel, and the pan is made from rust-resistant coated heavy carbon steel - hand wash the pan and put other parts to dishwasher for thorough cleaning. 【Stackable Design & Easy to Clean】:These souffle ramekins bowls with classic style and exquisite line design make these ramekins never get out of style, the stackable design saves more space for your cabinet. The internal and external glaze protects the ramekins from stains, The glaze of the pudding custard cup is smooth which means it can be easily washed in water. 【Simple yet functional】:The wire rack fits effortlessly inside the water bath pan, holding the ramekins above the water level to offer even heating while keeping your desserts above the water line. Simply use potholders to lift the entire rack out - no scalding, no burning! The included recipe and instructions on the package bottom will perfect your technique. 【Versatile Use】: All the white glossy ramekins adds artistic flavor to your dining table, let every dessert making no longer just a process, it's also a kind of enjoyment, you can use the ramekin set to make caramel pudding, souffle, jam, chopped blueberries, brushed butter, French onion soup, quiche and ice cream,etc. Please make sure the lid and ramekin are completely dry before every use. 【Perfect Bakeware Gift Set】: We will pack these porcelain ramekins very safely to prevent damage during transportation. If you are looking for a practical and surprising housewarming, Thanksgiving, wedding, Christmas or birthday gift for your family and friends who love cooking/baking, this ceremic ramekins set is undoubtedly your best choice.If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us, PLSFIT will do our best to serve you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v5cBIq0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PLSFIT","source_asin":"B09SZ37VJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ37VJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ37VJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
