window.products.push({"id":790526,"name":"OVENTE SK10112B Round Electric Frying Pan, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hLL3CgtYL._SL1395_.jpg","description":"Make your favorite meals all in one frying pan—without a stove or cooking range! The Ovente Granite Electric Frying Pan allows you to cook anything WITHOUT the help of a stove, range, or cooktop. Powered by 1400-Watts , it rapidly and evenly heats up the pan—leaving no hot or cold spots while saving you time and money on energy bills. From savory bacon and egg scrambles for breakfast to a custom-made pan pizza for dinner, this skillet can do it all with ease. It features Automatic Temperature Control, allowing you to maintain your desired cooking temperature automatically without having to keep adjusting the temperature knob—it does it for you! The Temperature Graduated Disc (°F) has several different heat settings that you can use for various dishes. Approximate temperature settings with some cooking ideas: MIN – Keeps temperature 212°(medium low) – Bacon, Eggs, Hamburgers, etc. 302° (medium) – Sausages, Meatloaf, etc. 392° (medium high) – Lemon Garlic Butter Chicken, BBQ Pork Chops, etc. 464° (high) – Pan Pizza, Juicy Steaks Keeps your freshly-cooked, homemade meal HOT for serving. When you’re done cooking, your skillet keeps your food hot by doubling as a buffet server as well! Simply turn the temperature control knob to “MIN”, which will keep it warm. The tempered glass lid has an integrated steam vent to trap heat while releasing excess steam, keeping your food hot, moist, and crispy. The smooth, cool-touch handles make it easy and safe to bring your freshly-made dish from kitchen to table. Cleanup is a cinch , too. Simply remove the temperature knob, wipe the nonstick surface to remove food particles, and wash with warm, soapy water. With cooking made this easy, you’ll continue to use your electric skillet time and time again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hLL3CgtYL._SL1395_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ovente","source_asin":"B074485DH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074485DH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074485DH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
