window.products.push({"id":790575,"name":"Pulatree Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain Relief, Odorless Contour Memory Foam Pillows with Cradles Design, Ergonomic Orthopedic Bed Pillows for Sleeping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ef-O2ZOOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Enjoy Your Sleeping Without Neck Pain] 8 HOURS EVERY NIGHT. Are you still suffering from neck pain while sleeping? Our proven contour design perfectly supports your head, neck, shoulder, and back. The innovative ergonomic design naturally and perfectly fits the curve spine, providing proper support for spine alignment. Sleep pillow design allowing you to shift between positions comfortably. You wake up feeling refreshed and any neck pain you used to suffer should disappear over time. [2 Heights - Designed for Different Sleepers] Our pillow has 2 different contour heights on either side, so you can choose whichever works better for your sleep posture. Butterfly design shape gives armrests, no more arms numbness. It offers enough room for your shoulders and makes good nasal airflow for back, side & stomach sleepers. The hole inside was designed to cradle your head for optimal support & reduce the pressure of the skull. It allows for a comfortable yet supportive night's sleep. [Safe & Odorless Memory Foam - A Healthy Sleep Ensured] The unique nontoxic, non-allergenic, molded foam design. The cervical pillow is made with high-quality rebound memory foam that is CertiPUR-US certified. Its temperature sensing, making the pillow FITS YOUR NECK perfectly. The best pillow for neck and shoulder pain is firm enough to hold the head at a healthy angle, but soft enough to alleviate pressure points. Choose us, the symbol of all-nature and great support. [Breathable & Removable Pillowcase & Lifetime Warranty] Pulatree cervical pillow are built with double breathable pillowcases. It is removable with zippered & machine washable. Pillow is made from hypoallergenic cotton and polyester with its soft and breathable fabric that allows air to circulate through the pillow all night long. It is gentle on your skin to stay crisp throughout the night - it retains moisture absorbency qualities to leave you from night sweat in a comfortable climate. [Hassle-Free & 100% Satisfaction] – Pick out an excellent ergonomic pillow for neck pain, and you may see your sleep improved in ways you would have never imagined. Not only will you enjoy waking up without a stiff neck, but you will also be likely to sleep better during the night. It's a BEST HEALTH CARE GIFT to show your care to somebody you love. You can now purchase with confidence. If you're not 100% in love with your pillow, our customized one-on-one service is always ready!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ef-O2ZOOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pulatree","source_asin":"B0BPSVDTXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSVDTXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSVDTXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
