window.products.push({"id":790604,"name":"Mueller AeroHeat Convection Toaster Oven, 8 Slice, Broil, Toast, Bake, Stainless Steel Finish, Timer, Auto-Off - Sound Alert, 3 Rack Position, Removab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YN8iW89bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multitasker - Multi-functional, space-saving, and efficient. Whether you crave a simple toast or a juicy steak, the AeroHeat Convection Toaster Oven will take care of your every cooking desire. With three cooking functions and optimized air-flow, your favorite dish will be cooked faster and browned more evenly. Compact with a sleek stainless steel finish, this countertop oven is the perfect multipurpose appliance for any kitchen scenario. Convection Technology - Ever find yourself hungry but in a hurry? With a powerful 1200W convection fan that distributes heat quickly and evenly, cooking in this convection oven is faster than a conventional oven. With 4x faster preheat, you’ll save both time and electrical energy. What’s more, the hot air circulation cooks food fast and needs less oil, giving you the option to prepare healthier meals for your loved ones. Bake, Broil, and Toast - The Mueller convection toaster oven gives you endless possibilities with 3 cooking functions: Bake, Broil, and Toast. Spaciously fits 8 bread slices across the rack or a 9” pizza. Make the most of the oven’s wide temperature range (140°- 480°F) and 3 rack positions. Accessories and Features – The Toaster Oven Countertop features a 60-Minute Timer with Sound Alert, Interior Light, and Auto Shut-Off for your safety and convenience. The 3-stage door opening prevents the door opening abruptly and allows for safe steam escape. Includes Baking Rack, Baking Pan and Toast Tongs for easy and safe pan removal. Removable slide-out Crumb Tray makes cleaning a breeze. Bonus Tasty Recipe Book for cooking inspiration. Superior Quality With Mueller - We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us. Our unparalleled 24/7 live telephone customer support is ready and waiting to assist with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YN8iW89bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mueller Austria","source_asin":"B08TVZQSLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TVZQSLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TVZQSLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":790605,"name":"RoomDividersNow Muslin Tension Rod Room Divider Kit - Medium A, 8ft Tall x 4ft - 6ft 8in Wide (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfi0ldp9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Looking for a great way to divide a room, create privacy, or hide clutter? RoomDividersNow tension rod room divider kits present a creative and stylish way to divide space in minutes. Tension rod kits come with everything needed to create and separate space up to 12.5 feet wide. This kit’s easy installation makes it perfect for many uses within your home. No drilling is required, so this kit is fantastic for temporary spaces like dorm rooms, rental units, and sublets. Simply adjust the rod to the size of your space and let the spring-loaded tension do the rest! DIVIDE and CONQUER small and big space with ease: * Shared Bedroom, Studio Apartment, Closet, Dorm, Loft, etc. The problem solving uses go on and on: * Create the perfect amount of privacy, hide clutter, separate functions, block sunlight, etc. Quality Construction: * Medium \"A\" Tension Rod Room Divider Kits (for spaces 4ft - 6ft 8in wide) include one 8ft tall x 10ft wide muslin room divider curtain and one 48in-80in wide tension rod * Dividers are made from high quality 100% hand-dyed cotton muslin fabric * Dividers are hemmed and finished on all sides (Non-Flame Retardant) * Dividers contain large 1 1/2in metal grommet rings * Please note, if a light is shining directly on the divider there can be a small amount of light that filters through * For maximum light reduction - please see our Premium Heavyweight Room Divider selection within our product catalog * Portable: If you live in a dorm or a rental these room dividers are a great solution. They are easily installed and easily packed up, moved, and reused! * Detailed installation instructions come with each kit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zfi0ldp9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Room/Dividers/Now","source_asin":"B01635TDKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01635TDKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01635TDKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
