window.products.push({"id":790741,"name":"Anectria 37\" Door Draft Stopper Adjustable Width from 1.37\" to 2.16\" Under Door Draft Blocker for Bottom of Doors Paste-free PVC Door Seam Strip Sound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rF64l3UOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional】: Our door strip adopts innovative sound insulation cavity design, which can reduce noise and improve sound insulation effect. At the same time, it can help you seal the door bottom well, reduce the loss of indoor air conditioning or heating, and help you save electricity and fuel bills. The stopper keeps cold air and heat outside with protection on both sides. Great for blocking light, dust and insects. 【Excellent Quality】: The door bottom sealing strip is made of high-quality PVC material, which has strong anti-aging properties and is flexible and flexible. The bottom adopts wave design, high resilience, environmental protection, heat resistance and cold resistance. Small in size and will not deform. The door seam strip can be cut according to the size of the door. 【Easy to Install】: No drilling or gluing required, just cut the door bottom seal to the size of the door, then slide the door seam strip to the bottom of the door for successful installation. PLEASE NOTE: When the width of the door is less than 4cm, it can be installed through the traceless glue(in package) without damaging your door.When you receive it that is slightly bent,don't worry, you can choose to heat it with a hair dryer or soak it in cold water for a few minutes to straighten. 【Shopping guide】The height of the door seam is 2.9CM, suitable for flat ground without threshold, the door thickness is between 3.5CM-5.5CM, and the gap at the bottom of the door is 0.3CM-1.5CM. Note: Concrete floors, security doors and glass doors are not applicable. 【Anti-insect & Dustproof】: This door bottom seal is perfectly integrated with the floor, preventing insects, cockroaches or dust from entering the room, keeping your room away from some small bugs and providing a clean and comfortable environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rF64l3UOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anectria","source_asin":"B09T5Z5P76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T5Z5P76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T5Z5P76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":790742,"name":"Dust Mite- and Allergen-Proof Comforter; “DreamFill/Premium Microfiber” (King; White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":360.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bi9pqSjqL._AC_SL1215_.jpg","description":"The MISSION: ALLERGY Premium Microfiber Fabric on the outside of these comforters is the ultimate allergen-barrier: totally effective, silky soft, and lightweight. With a mean pore size of 2 microns it blocks all allergens, yet is air-permeable, making it completely comfortable. It does not allow any allergen escape, as do many cotton barrier-fabrics. These MISSION: ALLERGY Allergen-Proof Comforters are filled with luxurious DreamFill, ultra-fine fibers that are as soft as silk, with superior lofting quality and a light, down-like feeling, providing softness, resilience, comfort, and warmth. These medical-grade comforters are suitable for adults or children with allergic asthma, allergic rhinitis, or allergic eczema—or simply for good hygiene. They are the ultimate allergen-proof comforters for protection, comfort, and durability. 10” quilted box pattern. Available in White, Natural and Blue-Gray; color-coordinated Shams and Bedskirts are also available. 100% Woven Polyester Microfiber shell; 100% polyester filling. Note: These allergen-proof comforters are available exclusively from MISSION: ALLERGY. Do not confuse them with other comforters sold as “hypoallergenic”. The term “hypoallergenic” refers only to the fact that the interior filling of the comforter does not itself cause allergy—not to whether it can become colonized with dust mites! Our comforters have a Premium Microfiber allergen-barrier exterior, and thus cannot become colonized with mites (or bedbugs). They therefore do not require encasing or hot water washing. “Be sure you get … from a reputable company, like Mission: Allergy…” THE NEW YORK TIMES \"Much Ado About Dust Mites\" “Say sayonara to dust mites. Dr. Fost recommends Mission: Allergy.” HEALTH MAGAZINE \"How healthy is your bedroom?\" “Skip the cheapie versions…invest in Mission: Allergy Premium Microfiber…” MEN'S HEALTH MAGAZINE \"Clearing the Air on Allergies\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bi9pqSjqL._AC_SL1215_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission","source_asin":"B0099SX0JW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0099SX0JW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0099SX0JW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
