window.products.push({"id":790798,"name":"T&G CrushGrind Spice Mill with Removable Glass Base, 12.5 cm, Black, Whole Dried Herbs Spices Seeds Chilli Flakes / Fully Adjustable Ceramic Manual Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UTBk9+72L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description CrushGrind by T&G - “The World’s Best MillsInches Launched in the UK in 1998 - and setting the standard for mills ever since - T&G’s CrushGrind collection combines creativity and innovation with the highest levels of quality and design. The result: a premium range of salt and pepper mills that also make the perfect gift. T&G’s CrushGrind mills feature a ceramic mechanism that achieves a finer grind than conventional steel equivalents. It is both non-porous and non-corrosive and therefore, unlike metal, it will not oxidise food. The unique grinding system requires no central spindle, which means that filling the mills couldn’t be more straightforward. The CrushGrind mechanism is suitable for salt, pepper, herbs and spices using a single mill, which eliminates the cross-usage restrictions that apply to other similar products. It is regulated by a simple rotating wheel at either the base or top of the mills and will produce an array of both fine and coarse grinds. The CrushGrind mechanism is excellent for grinding dried herbs and spices, which releases their essential oils, restoring smell and taste to the level of freshly picked ones. The ceramic used in T&G’s CrushGrind mills is extremely tough and ensures excellent ongoing performance for many years. In fact, test results have established that the mills remain in perfect working order after grinding 50 kilos of pepper and 50 kilos of salt through the same grinder - the equivalent of 200 years of normal domestic use! As a mark of confidence in their functionality and durability, all CrushGrind mills carry a lifetime mechanism guarantee. The grinding apparatus can be easily removed from the mills, making it ideal for cleaning and general maintenance. T&G - the Market Leaders in Salt and Pepper Mills Crafted from materials that include FSC certified beech, hevea, painted hevea, olive wood, black walnut, crystal clear acrylic and stainless steel, T&G offer an unrivalled range of salt and pepper mills. All T&G mills have been designed in the UK, beginning as sketches on a blank sheet of paper and offering a unique combination of both classic and traditional concepts. About the Brand Established in 1975, T&G is one of Europe’s leading brands of everyday kitchen essentials and is very much a family-run business. All products are designed in the UK. This means thoughtfully designed, responsibly-sourced products that are made to withstand the demands of modern-day life. The wide-ranging assortments provide all the kitchen accessories that are needed for everyday usage and entertaining guests - even for finding that all-important gift. As well as their commitment to innovation, quality and longevity, T&G also remain dedicated to ethical practices and sourcing from well-managed, sustainable forests and plantations and hold FSC certification. Set Contains: 1 x T&G CrushGrind Spice Mill with Removable Glass Base, 12.5 cm, Black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UTBk9+72L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T&G","source_asin":"B073ZH1D7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-790798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073ZH1D7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073ZH1D7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
